{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938600/extras/1810009ff1d4ddd5127fad969eb7e7cc.poster.avif?t=1761287842\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938600/extras/1810009ff1d4ddd5127fad969eb7e7cc.webm?t=1761287842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938600/extras/1810009ff1d4ddd5127fad969eb7e7cc.mp4?t=1761287842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the fog-shrouded ruins to seek the scattered Forbidden Relics, weaving together countless combinations of the Dice of Fate, and awaken the ancient powers slumbering in the abyss. Bind weapons, sigils, rituals, and strategy into one, forging the ultimate artifact capable of rending the darkness. Survive the endless cycles of fate with courage and cunning, facing unnameable horrors, so that humanity\u2019s final hope may still shine beneath the gaze of the Nameless Enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938600/extras/3b86c2d1649781c5303e7ee9cfe1da1f.avif?t=1761287842\" width=616 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938600/extras/4ba09ada3b8c2356c025d5b5802c2c21.poster.avif?t=1761287842\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938600/extras/4ba09ada3b8c2356c025d5b5802c2c21.webm?t=1761287842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938600/extras/4ba09ada3b8c2356c025d5b5802c2c21.mp4?t=1761287842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a desolate land, brave fog and shadow to traverse perilous terrain, gathering artifacts and tomes etched with cryptic runes\u2014each step peeling back the cold veil that conceals the nameless truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938600/extras/a19eb350b887412da39dbeb5af8b5410.avif?t=1761287842\" width=616 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938600/extras/20d9dc53a876be7be562492ad8dc6c62.poster.avif?t=1761287842\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938600/extras/20d9dc53a876be7be562492ad8dc6c62.webm?t=1761287842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938600/extras/20d9dc53a876be7be562492ad8dc6c62.mp4?t=1761287842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A handful of dice, shaped by countless choices and trials, form a destiny of your own design. With wisdom and nerve, weave intricate dice formations, where every cast may tip the scales, rewriting the path between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938600/extras/02ec8ab11165b177d24312f0a25b4b11.avif?t=1761287842\" width=616 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938600/extras/c81e34c570b9958b15b3e182debda6bc.poster.avif?t=1761287842\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938600/extras/c81e34c570b9958b15b3e182debda6bc.webm?t=1761287842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938600/extras/c81e34c570b9958b15b3e182debda6bc.mp4?t=1761287842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From shattered fragments and forbidden materials, follow ancient, perilous principles and hidden, precise laws to fuse them, step by step, into the supreme weapon. Each ratio and combination is a journey into the unknown laws of creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938600/extras/d4c2f90ddd92a488c135486ad9bc0052.avif?t=1761287842\" width=616 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938600/extras/a45653514637b15ca73c6cae614dbd38.poster.avif?t=1761287842\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938600/extras/a45653514637b15ca73c6cae614dbd38.webm?t=1761287842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938600/extras/a45653514637b15ca73c6cae614dbd38.mp4?t=1761287842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront horrors that stir in the deep sea and the void. Gather every ounce of strength, intertwining weapons, sigils, rituals, and tactics. Engage in battles through diverse strategic styles, and claim rare treasures from the vanquished abominations.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938600?t=1761287842","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i